# Secrets (wrangler secret put <NAME>). Empty values here only generate binding types.
# What each one is and how to get it: README.md, Configuration.

# {"eip155:421614":"https://…","eip155:43113":"https://…","eip155:10143":"https://…"}
WALLET_RPC_URLS=""
# Submits bundles (pays outer gas, refunded by the EntryPoint from the paymaster deposit).
RELAYER_PRIVATE_KEY=""
# Signs gas sponsorships; must be the paymaster's sponsor signer.
SPONSOR_PRIVATE_KEY=""
# ES256 private JWK (JSON) that signs sessions.
SESSION_PRIVATE_JWK=""
TURNSTILE_SECRET_KEY=""
# Optional: Alchemy Address Activity webhooks, one per network: {"eip155:421614":{"id":"wh_…","signing_key":"whsec_…"}}
ALCHEMY_WEBHOOKS=""
# Optional: Alchemy auth token (dashboard) that adds members' addresses to those webhooks.
ALCHEMY_AUTH_TOKEN=""
# Optional: Firebase service account JSON (project_id, client_email, private_key) for payment notifications.
FIREBASE_SERVICE_ACCOUNT=""
# Optional, enables Stellar: secret key (S…) of the Stellar account that creates members' Stellar
# accounts, pays their fees and relays CCTP transfers toward Stellar. Members' Stellar addresses
# derive from it: never change it once members have one.
STELLAR_SECRET_KEY=""
# Optional: Stellar RPC (default: the network's public RPC).
STELLAR_RPC_URL=""
# Optional: Envio API token (envio.dev → API tokens). With it, the networks whose INDEX_SOURCES name a
# `hypersync` URL are reconciled through Envio HyperSync, and members' earlier history is read.
ENVIO_API_TOKEN=""
